         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Most Spoken Language\n\nWe can consider mathematics as the language of nature; in this way, it is present everywhere.\n\nAs we study mathematics, we come to understand how nature works. With this knowledge, we can create, among other things, the electronic device you are using to learn.\n\nIn this lesson, we will see that humanity has been learning the language of nature, with mistakes and successes that help us understand the universe.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "9fca9377-a5bd-47a5-8113-1bdb35e4e33f",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "9fca9377-a5bd-47a5-8113-1bdb35e4e33f",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In Us\n\nWe have already seen that we can use numbers with our hands, but not only that. Look below: we can also number different parts of our body with them.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"https://www.historytracers.org/images/HistoryTracers/HTHumanBody.jpg\" />",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Human body with its numbered parts.*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "1085204f-72c0-44cf-aed8-e49e307f0599",
