         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "1085204f-72c0-44cf-aed8-e49e307f0599",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "shocking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 0,
               "uuid": "1e007481-9bd3-4a09-ad4d-6e812fe79641",
               "text": "Parque Arqueológico Copán",
               "page": "https://ihah.hn/parque-arqueologico-copan/",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "5390fa3b-735f-4e22-ac98-178303a13fdb",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=1009578c-3097-4183-9f10-c6dd0a833d5b",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In Our Texts\n\nOne of the places where numbers are present is in texts. For example, we can count the letters and the words we are reading. Moreover, there are texts that do not use the alphabet; they use hieroglyphs, like the stela at Copán, Honduras. We can also count these hieroglyphs.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"https://www.historytracers.org/images/Copan/CopanWholeTextStelaAltar.png\" />",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Stela, altar and hieroglyphs in the form of a staircase at Copán, Honduras.*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "8d37d550-e695-4270-9174-96a18bd89f5c",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "8d37d550-e695-4270-9174-96a18bd89f5c",
