               "uuid": "cb216fdf-1282-42e0-aaf4-3547b53857d7",
               "text": "Black, J.A. et al.",
               "page": "https://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/section2/c211.htm",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "1998",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 0,
               "uuid": "c8dd380c-6f66-415c-94fa-b116308adeef",
               "text": "Black, J.A. et al. (Tradução)",
               "page": "https://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/section2/tr211.htm",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "1998",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "376a5f3c-c598-40ee-95ad-5db9046ab8e2",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=tree&arg=376a5f3c-c598-40ee-95ad-5db9046ab8e2",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Ages\n\nOur knowledge about the past of humanity, of the planet and of the universe is something new. But this does not mean that, before, we did not try to explain it in a poetic way.\n\nFor example, the Sumerian King List, which contains real kings and others never proven to have existed, says that, in different cities, there were 8 kings who, together, ruled for 241,200 years, with one of them ruling for 43,200 years.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"https://www.historytracers.org/images/Ashmolean/KingList.jpg\" />",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Sumerian King List. © Ashmolean Museum, University of Oxford.*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "a6b3df3d-c1d2-4897-a567-508887dbb8b1",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "a6b3df3d-c1d2-4897-a567-508887dbb8b1",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 0,
               "uuid": "cb216fdf-1282-42e0-aaf4-3547b53857d7",
               "text": "Black, J.A. et al.",
               "page": "https://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/section2/c211.htm",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "1998",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 0,
               "uuid": "c8dd380c-6f66-415c-94fa-b116308adeef",
               "text": "Black, J.A. et al. (Tradução)",
               "page": "https://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/section2/tr211.htm",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "1998",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "376a5f3c-c598-40ee-95ad-5db9046ab8e2",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=tree&arg=376a5f3c-c598-40ee-95ad-5db9046ab8e2",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "The Sumerian King List attributes periods of rule of millennia - more than a thousand years - to some people. As we move through the texts, we see that this period gradually reduces to centuries - periods of more than 100 years - and, finally, reaches the periods of time we live today.\n\nWould it be possible for people to have lived for centuries or millennia, as the Sumerians wrote and other peoples possibly learned from them?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "74ebbfc2-8d37-4d29-b6be-eb38acc8c060",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "no",
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "74ebbfc2-8d37-4d29-b6be-eb38acc8c060",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "shocking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "7fa66cfd-dca8-4a17-bead-e79954ba684a",
               "text": "Wood, B., & Collard, M",
               "page": "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/13188094_The_Human_Genus",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "1999",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "f4f9c247-4a7e-4277-8691-99659cf2c240",
               "text": "Cy",
               "page": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7u1-tAMrIgM",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2021",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "ab1dda1e-95c2-4087-8299-e851e58bdc6f",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=tree&arg=33c83383-b9b5-43ec-987d-68f027f342b2",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Wrong, but Right\n\nWhen the Sumerians proposed that a few kings had ruled for more than 200,000 years, they wrote something impossible; after all, the lifespan of people in the past was not different from today's.\n\nOn the other hand, even without having the necessary knowledge, they managed to conclude that humanity does not have a short history.\n\nToday, we know that several human species existed and that, possibly, others are still to be discovered.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p id=\"circtri0\"><div class=\"atlasCircleContainer\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 340\" class=\"circle-draw\" id=\"svgcirctri0\">  <defs> <marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"3\" markerHeight=\"3\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"> <path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" /></marker> </defs> <text x=\"42\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 70, 60)\">Paranthropus africanus</text> <text x=\"72\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 70, 60)\">Australopithecus africanus</text> <text x=\"112\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 110, 60)\">Paranthropus aethiopicus</text> <text x=\"152\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 150, 60)\">Paranthropus boisei</text> <text x=\"192\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 190, 60)\">Paranthropus robustus</text> <text x=\"232\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 230, 60)\">Homo habilis</text> <text x=\"272\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 270, 60)\">Homo rudolfensis</text> <text x=\"312\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 310, 60)\">Homo ergaster</text> <text x=\"352\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 350, 60)\">Homo erectus</text> <text x=\"392\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 390, 60)\">Homo heidelbergensis</text> <text x=\"432\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 430, 60)\">Homo neanderthalensis</text> <text x=\"472\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"0.6em\" font-style=\"italic\" transform=\"rotate(-35, 470, 60)\">Homo sapiens</text> <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"324\" x2=\"475\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"253\" y1=\"294\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"273\" y1=\"274\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"295\" y1=\"254\" x2=\"126\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"164\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"197\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"164\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"295\" y1=\"254\" x2=\"242\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"295\" y1=\"254\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"397\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"326\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"397\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"397\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"404\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /> <line x1=\"397\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"444\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"black\" /></svg></div></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Relationship between humans and closely related species.*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "08b8faee-c9d5-4195-af8d-43573971f07d",
         "prev": "",
