               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we learned some places where we use numbers. We saw that some information was only proposed - such as millenary lives - while other information was proven - such as a universe with billions of years.\n\nIn neither of the two scenarios are there people alive today who were present when something happened. Even so, thanks to the studies and to the evidence based on these studies, we can state whether something is a fact or a poem.\n\nAll of this will become clearer as you continue studying.",
